{"url":"https://www.saudia.com/en-SA/about-us/soar-program","status":200,"title":"Saudia Soar Program (S.O.A.R) | Saudia","desc":"Learn about the Soar Program by Saudia designed to develop future aviation professionals. Discover training opportunities and apply today to grow your career in aviation with Saudia.","finalUrl":"https://www.saudia.com/en-SA/about-us/soar-program","bodyClass":"white-theme baseLang mWebHomePage","h":8244,"sig":[{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-image-link-list"],"h":460,"headings":0,"imgs":1,"text":0},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-title-text"],"h":4971,"headings":34,"imgs":20,"text":7311},{"tag":"app-jss-columns","comps":["app-jss-title-text"],"h":1313,"headings":0,"imgs":5,"text":3894}],"h1":["Saudia Soar Program (S.O.A.R) | Saudia"],"html":"<sc-placeholder _ngcontent-saudiawebapp-c260489156=\"\" name=\"jss-main\"><!----><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container-fluid\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-image-link-list class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"custom-carousel imagelinklist--content-embedded h--left v--top image--slider md--adjustment ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div appswiper=\"\" fxflex=\"auto\" class=\"swiper-container ng-star-inserted swiper-initialized swiper-horizontal swiper-backface-hidden\"><div class=\"swiper-wrapper\"><div class=\"swiper-slide ng-star-inserted swiper-slide-active\"><div fxlayout=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"\" fxflexfill=\"\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"swiper-slide__image desktop-view ng-star-inserted\"><img fetchpriority=\"high\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"600\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/soar_header_en.ashx?h=600&amp;iar=0&amp;w=1920&amp;rev=59c534334fbf41bb84ab6670d4333f90&amp;hash=221EF876D88911E30CDC66701962839F\" class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"image-gradient\" id=\"1f2b1c1a-43db-43c9-9b2a-5e9d01ae0449\"></div></div><!----><!----><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"swiper-slide__content\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----></div></div></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><div class=\"custom-pagination ng-star-inserted\"><div class=\"container\"><div id=\"cpage_banner\" class=\"custom-pages\"></div></div></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></app-jss-image-link-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text remove-margin isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">​\n\n<div class=\"custom-content__wrapper\">\n    <div class=\"container\">\n        \n        <h2>Welcome</h2>\n        <p class=\"intro-text-width\">The S.O.A.R program is a launchpad and transformative journey for aspiring changemakers. We are calling on individuals who strive to achieve their goals, overcome challenges, and rise above society’s expectations on an ongoing journey of development and prosperity.</p>\n        <p>If you want to soar your career towards the future, Stay tuned for the next journey of S.O.A.R.</p>\n        <p>Registration for S.O.A.R 26 is now <strong>closed</strong>.</p>\n        \n        <!--<div class=\"cta-btn\">\n            <div style=\"background: #00803e;display: inline-block;\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4398472974\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"join-alfursan-btn\" style=\"display: flex;color: #ffffff;\" target=\"_blank\">Apply Now!<span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"material-symbols-outlined\" style=\"display: inline;\">arrow_forward</span></a>\n            </div>\n        </div>-->\n        \n<div class=\"image-container-intro intro-img-pos saudia-video-wrapper\">\n            <video class=\"saudia-video-desktop\" controls=\"\" preload=\"metadata\">\n                <source src=\"https://media.dcloud.saudia.com/saudiawebapp/videos/SOAR-Promo-1080p.webm\" type=\"video/webm\">\n                <source src=\"https://media.dcloud.saudia.com/saudiawebapp/videos/SOAR-Promo-1080p.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n                Your browser does not support the video tag.\n            </video>\n            \n            <video class=\"saudia-video-mobile\" controls=\"\" preload=\"metadata\">\n                <source src=\"https://media.dcloud.saudia.com/saudiawebapp/videos/SOAR-Promo-720p.webm\" type=\"video/webm\">\n                <source src=\"https://media.dcloud.saudia.com/saudiawebapp/videos/SOAR-Promo-720p.mp4\" type=\"video/mp4\">\n                Your browser does not support the video tag.\n            </video>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div>\n            <h2>Get to know the S.O.A.R Program</h2>\n            <p>The S.O.A.R program is not just a professional journey; it offers an extraordinary one-year learning experience. You will gain practical skills, hands-on training, and in-depth industry insights to help you soar to new horizons.</p>\n            <p>We are bringing together fresh graduates to unlock their full potential with high-level training from industry experts across various fields, all in one place.</p>\n            <p>You will also benefit from numerous other advantages*, including:</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"box-container\">\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/benefits-salary.ashx?rev=789b0fd4a98b46ab8d7b06bdc1feffac&amp;hash=F92B2B067FF39B01B3F5EBDB5F505245\"></h2>\n                    <p>Rewarding<br>Payment</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/benefits-tickets.ashx?rev=3b734910de3c43838c26626f3918c385&amp;hash=4DECCCB5BE00D5E0EE2874CDC6AF7603\"></h2>\n                    <p>Flight<br>Tickets </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/benefits-job.ashx?rev=6c9cc934072c4c70a61dff69b3f4e855&amp;hash=F5DFB0D1C56F687703FFC5CF0379138D\"></h2>\n                    <p>Career<br>Development </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/benefits-med-insurance.ashx?rev=e9ee207be5a344f897b09d93f55ca955&amp;hash=4E750B32EF364C1ACFC5D7AF1100EF59\"></h2>\n                    <p>Medical<br>Insurance </p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/benefits-social.ashx?rev=2435b5c2486a4c16a5a1147d53b43978&amp;hash=790A0EA43C2F536365FEF6FA4D6DC1F2\"></h2>\n                    <p>GOSI<br>Registration</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/benefits-training.ashx?rev=19b4a69565fb4adea30186e643223d53&amp;hash=8FD4D5F85447C62A82BAC96CB40A1F60\"></h2>\n                    <p>International<br>Assignment</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <p>* As per Saudia policy</p>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div>\n            <img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/SOAR3-opt.ashx?rev=fdb6ebe9ae284034b3a8b70668af99c4&amp;hash=1FC18D5D89B639F647F1EFEF7E0A0F79\">\n        </div>\n        \n        <div>\n            <h2>Requirements</h2>\n            <p>To be part of the S.O.A.R program, applicants must meet the following criteria:</p>\n            <div class=\"box-container\">\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h3>Saudi<br>Nationals</h3>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h3>Bachelor’s<br>Degree</h3>\n                    <p>with a GPA of 2.75/4<br>or 3.75/5</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h3>Master’s<br>Degree</h3>\n                    <p>with a GPA of 2.75/4<br>or 3.75/5</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h3>Fresh<br>Graduates</h3>\n                    <p>or those with up to 2 years of experience</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h3>English<br>Proficiency</h3>\n                    <p>IELTS (5.5), STEP (75), TOEFL (46 iBT), or (475 PBT)</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div>\n            <img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/SOAR4-opt.ashx?rev=a4cf9abc7e44499492fb639fc829e663&amp;hash=7630EFA6BD67EE214FD3C03D774FF7AC\">\n        </div>\n        \n        <div>\n            <h2>Tracks</h2>\n            <p>The program offers a variety of career tracks to suit different interests and skills:</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"box-container\">\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/path-comm.ashx?rev=938cb74f9f164f3e91b4f6e9ff69185d&amp;hash=E8886AA002952241C65D493A2A2409AE\"></h2>\n                    <p>Commercial<br>Affairs</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/path-ops.ashx?rev=51efcb7b976e40848bc6d430adc099d9&amp;hash=3988FA9BD8E963A036C94F17A43B75D9\"></h2>\n                    <p>Flight<br>Operations</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/path-safe.ashx?rev=36ea228068394ab89822afafe5fd0679&amp;hash=315EEC6B9CF562C4878EBD8EE82A6737\"></h2>\n                    <p>Safety &amp;<br>Quality</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/path-exp.ashx?rev=eae752ac3304498cae8ccb0bb8861e14&amp;hash=1921977ED0042659EAC1442863598550\"></h2>\n                    <p>Customer<br>Experience</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/path-stat.ashx?rev=e07b1dbefdb74ef998485192cea51a94&amp;hash=76CC59B5C3EED66B97DF688745E83997\"></h2>\n                    <p>Advanced<br>Analytics</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/path-it.ashx?rev=f728815674b84d95b384393bc61dd492&amp;hash=997DFC6CD47FDAE1E3D4C0C904B3904D\"></h2>\n                    <p>Information<br>Technology</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"box-container\">\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/path-hr.ashx?rev=c2de94012d934dd8956ebf79ea9d1b15&amp;hash=D4DC46E1373F046251B7CE64F6459762\"></h2>\n                    <p>Human<br>Resources</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/path-legal.ashx?rev=bd5fe049ec0843f7a696711674c8dcdf&amp;hash=108B58C049E6111CBC4D63C6774A780F\"></h2>\n                    <p>Legal</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/path-fin.ashx?rev=d2157ad96f4245cebb7f134198672cff&amp;hash=322EB3E2710DB28BABCD78B1ED859FE0\"></h2>\n                    <p>Finance &amp;<br>Accounting</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/path-fleet.ashx?rev=8edce9be7ece4f6c9f40a2667903cb45&amp;hash=08AC77BAB953220B55A729049EF94488\"></h2>\n                    <p>Fleet<br>Management</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/path-plan.ashx?rev=43162adc6e464a04b3ed29a42661c5a9&amp;hash=1E2A903E92A398533B6E643BEFDCDBDA\"></h2>\n                    <p>Engineering &amp;<br>Planning</p>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"box\">\n                    <h2><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/path-purchase.ashx?rev=a4823c17e3654597b74ce8b60a00ad5b&amp;hash=EB6CBCC0DD47E5BE3680ED70842B39A6\"></h2>\n                    <p>Procurement</p>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div>\n            <h2>Applicants Journey</h2>\n            \n            <div class=\"saudia-process-wrapper\" dir=\"ltr\">\n                <div class=\"saudia-process-grid\">\n                    \n                    <div class=\"saudia-process-card\">\n                        <div class=\"saudia-process-badge\">1</div>\n                        <h3 class=\"saudia-process-title\">Online Application &amp;<br>Initial Filtering</h3>\n                        <p class=\"saudia-process-desc\">Your application will be reviewed to ensure you meet the basic eligibility criteria for the program</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"saudia-process-card\">\n                        <div class=\"saudia-process-badge\">2</div>\n                        <h3 class=\"saudia-process-title\">Online AI<br>Interview</h3>\n                        <p class=\"saudia-process-desc\">Applicants who pass the initial filtering will be invited to complete an online AI-powered interview. You will be asked to record short video responses to a set of pre-defined questions</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"saudia-process-card\">\n                        <div class=\"saudia-process-badge\">3</div>\n                        <h3 class=\"saudia-process-title\">Psychometric<br>Assessment (In-Person)</h3>\n                        <p class=\"saudia-process-desc\">Candidates will complete a psychometric assessment aligned with the company's core competencies. This assessment helps us understand your behavioral strengths, work style, and potential fit</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"saudia-process-card\">\n                        <div class=\"saudia-process-badge\">4</div>\n                        <h3 class=\"saudia-process-title\">Technical Interview<br>(In-Person)</h3>\n                        <p class=\"saudia-process-desc\">Shortlisted applicants will then be invited for an in-person technical interview to evaluate their knowledge and skills relevant to their chosen track</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"saudia-process-card\">\n                        <div class=\"saudia-process-badge\">5</div>\n                        <h3 class=\"saudia-process-title\">Executive Panel Interview<br>&amp; Presentation (In-Person)</h3>\n                        <p class=\"saudia-process-desc\">Finalists will meet with a panel of company executives. You will be asked to prepare and present on a specific topic, followed by a Q&amp;A session</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                    <div class=\"saudia-process-card\">\n                        <div class=\"saudia-process-badge\">6</div>\n                        <h3 class=\"saudia-process-title\">Onboarding</h3>\n                        <p class=\"saudia-process-desc\">Candidates who successfully pass all stages will receive an offer to join the program and begin the onboarding process</p>\n                    </div>\n\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <!--<div style=\"margin-top: 4rem;\">\n            <div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: center;\">\n                <a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/jobs/view/4398472974\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/join-en.ashx?rev=9747e1ad4c2d4b088a01e92046112679&amp;hash=809A7E2E6582010D44B7AA4223174EBE\" /></a>\n            </div>\n        </div>-->\n        \n    </div>\n</div>​</p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-title-text class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><div class=\"title-text isCashMilesInView ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><p appexcerpttext=\"\" class=\"titleTextSub ng-star-inserted\">\n\n\n<div class=\"saudia-testimonials-wrapper\" dir=\"ltr\">\n  <div class=\"saudia-testimonials-grid\">\n    \n    <article class=\"saudia-testimonial-card\">\n      <img src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/lamar-avatar.ashx?rev=9e91ec56316b49d998485561f1891bf4&amp;hash=570FAC2CACE3AF5BFE4070597C45B36B\" alt=\"Lamar AlThubaiti\" class=\"saudia-testimonial-avatar\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"saudia-testimonial-content\">\n        <p class=\"saudia-testimonial-quote\">\n          SOAR enhanced my skills in <span class=\"saudia-testimonial-highlight\">professional communication and organizational learning and development</span>, giving me a strong foundation and confidence to shape my career in the aviation world.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"saudia-testimonial-author\">\n        <h4 class=\"saudia-testimonial-name\">Lamar AlThubaiti</h4>\n        <p class=\"saudia-testimonial-role\">Learning &amp; Development, Saudia Group</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"saudia-testimonial-card\">\n      <img src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/jiad-avatar.ashx?rev=a18b3cfdebc249d3b1e99765d1a733a3&amp;hash=D15AACFE3D1FA7FB3B9132C556A432D9\" alt=\"Jiad A Alshehri\" class=\"saudia-testimonial-avatar\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"saudia-testimonial-content\">\n        <p class=\"saudia-testimonial-quote\">\n          Through S.O.A.R, I gained a deeper understanding of how <span class=\"saudia-testimonial-highlight\">different departments work together to drive business success</span>, expanding my perspective on the organization as a whole.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"saudia-testimonial-author\">\n        <h4 class=\"saudia-testimonial-name\">Jiad A Alshehri</h4>\n        <p class=\"saudia-testimonial-role\">Procurement, Saudia Technic</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"saudia-testimonial-card\">\n      <img src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/eithar-avatar.ashx?rev=81b736def79c4166a24b5a6a97c7d4f3&amp;hash=EE894F0BF0693F239D06BA8513CD99B0\" alt=\"Eithar Alyaqoob\" class=\"saudia-testimonial-avatar\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"saudia-testimonial-content\">\n        <p class=\"saudia-testimonial-quote\">\n          S.O.A.R strengthened my <span class=\"saudia-testimonial-highlight\">confidence</span> and encouraged me to embrace <span class=\"saudia-testimonial-highlight\">new challenges and opportunities</span>, helping me grow both professionally and personally.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"saudia-testimonial-author\">\n        <h4 class=\"saudia-testimonial-name\">Eithar Alyaqoob</h4>\n        <p class=\"saudia-testimonial-role\">Safety &amp; Quality, Saudia</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"saudia-testimonial-card\">\n      <img src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/mohammed-avatar.ashx?rev=f62bfef7f61444d9821e8d8b501898a0&amp;hash=2F628AA39A2E900B821511328FB0A65B\" alt=\"Mohammed Andijani\" class=\"saudia-testimonial-avatar\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"saudia-testimonial-content\">\n        <p class=\"saudia-testimonial-quote\">\n          Through SOAR, I have developed strong capabilities in <span class=\"saudia-testimonial-highlight\">data analysis and project management</span> within a short time, accelerating my readiness to the job field and expanding my perspective across the organization.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"saudia-testimonial-author\">\n        <h4 class=\"saudia-testimonial-name\">Mohammed Andijani</h4>\n        <p class=\"saudia-testimonial-role\">Saudia Real Estate</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n    <article class=\"saudia-testimonial-card\">\n      <img src=\"/-/media/SaudiaWebApp/data/media/img/Pioneer/abdullah-avatar.ashx?rev=c94deab84bb144c0a5b816ee078bd8ff&amp;hash=2BCE0B6BD829F142005A2072FBCE472A\" alt=\"Abdullah Mandurah\" class=\"saudia-testimonial-avatar\" loading=\"lazy\">\n      <div class=\"saudia-testimonial-content\">\n        <p class=\"saudia-testimonial-quote\">\n          Within a short period, S.O.A.R enabled me to <span class=\"saudia-testimonial-highlight\">gain knowledge and experience beyond what I had learned in my previous roles</span>, giving me greater clarity in my career path.\n        </p>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"saudia-testimonial-author\">\n        <h4 class=\"saudia-testimonial-name\">Abdullah Mandurah</h4>\n        <p class=\"saudia-testimonial-role\">Procurement, Saudia</p>\n      </div>\n    </article>\n\n  </div>\n</div></p><!----><!----><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div class=\"container\"><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><app-jss-image-link-list class=\"ng-star-inserted\"><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----><!----></app-jss-image-link-list><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\"flex-container\"><div><!----><!----><div fxlayout=\"row\" fxlayout.xs=\"column\" fxlayoutalign=\"flex-start\" class=\"custom-row\"><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><div class=\"flex-col\"><sc-placeholder fxlayout=\"row\" class=\"flex-placeholder\"><!----><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><app-jss-columns><div class=\